/*

        Name:           Nora
        Location:       Crossroads House
        Description:    Nora will initiate dialogue when the player enters his room. He has three well-armed guards and carries a .223 Pistol. The player won't get far with him until Warren recommends you for the job; this happens when the Brahmin are cured, the well problem is solved and/or the slaver operation has been destroyed.

           Created: 07/10/2020 20:28:51

*/

